th xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is much smaller than volume of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo></math>. Assume <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo></math> treated as an ideal gas]"}, "options": [{"id": "3ca372", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f852ee0e063d9294907"}, {"id": "b44725", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f852ee0e063d9294908"}, {"id": "9e74c5", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f852ee0e063d9294909"}, {"id": "85a3da", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f852ee0e063d929490a"}], "questionLabels": []}, {"_id": "69de4f852ee0e063d929490b", "type": "numerical", "chapters": ["60c9e849ea076dc381c0df8c"], "topics": ["60e2fada66f9ce3f243b4783"], "concepts": ["60e567dc499d1e49588f9cb8"], "question": {"text": "The heat of combustion of solid benzoic acid at constant volume is \\(-321.30 \\mathrm{~kJ}\\) at \\(27^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}\\). The heat of combustion at constant pressure is \\((-321.30-x \\mathrm{R}) \\mathrm{kJ}\\), the value of \\(x\\) is _______."}, "options": [{"id": "a0f7b2", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f852ee0e063d929490c"}, {"id": "7ea917", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f852ee0e063d929490d"}, {"id": "d7b07f", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f852ee0e063d929490e"}, {"id": "35ccc8", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f852ee0e063d929490f"}], "questionLabels": []}, {"_id": "69de4f852ee0e063d9294910", "type": "numerical", "chapters": ["60c9e849ea076dc381c0df8c"], "topics": ["60e2fada66f9ce3f243b4783"], "concepts": ["60e2fad966f9ce3f243b473a"], "question": {"text": "<p>Consider the following data</p><p>Heat of combustion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>241</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Heat of combustion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>393</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Heat of combustion of&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mi>OH</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>)</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1234</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>The heat of formation of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mi>OH</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mo>)</mo></math> _____ <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>kJ</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> (Nearest integer).</p>"}, "options": [{"id": "4e947d", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f852ee0e063d9294911"}, {"id": "c5362d", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f85